abstract: >-
  A working preprint on language-relative semantic identification,
  agreement queries, finite-dimensional Boolean-algebra criteria,
  and finite augmented-cellular-automaton evidence checks.
  The included Lean source proves finite coding and certificate-predicate
  statements, not the complete 64-cell dynamical construction.
keywords:
  - hypothesis languages
  - semantic identification
  - version spaces
  - active queries
  - runtime certificates
  - Rule 110
